// prompt: column rv of the typed AST store (after ax, cTyN words): the aux type of a node, read by the emitter (Emit.rv): for a method node recv.op(..) the receiver type (the local's type when the typer saw the call; Typer.ltGet is keyed by file-local binder token and is overwritten by later defs and files), for an Array.tabulate[F] call the type F. A node is a method or a call, never both.
def Typer.moRv(s: Typer.S, k: I64): I64 = Typer.moAx(s, Typer.cget(s, Typer.cTyN())) + k

